+    "reqincrease": 5,
+    "description_en": "You can set traps to protect your property from intruders! At rank 1, you can craft traps from the Traps section, p.189. Traps have a complexity of 2 and require the components for a complexity 2 item. If you fail the INT + Repair test, your trap misfires— resolve the trap’s effect against yourself. At rank 2, when you fail the INT + Repair test to set the trap it does not misfire. Instead you succeed at cost, and the gamemaster creates a complication related to the trap (i.e., it is easier to spot, deals less damage, or otherwise doesn’t work as intended). Each time you take this perk, the level requirement increases by 5.",
+    "source": "focharactersheet",
+    "sourceUrl": "https://focharactersheet.vercel.app"
